== Walkthrough ==
This chapter requires precise timing. You have to wait for the gravity to switch up. When it is two seconds away from flipping again, quickly walk forward and fall up. The gravity will then reverse, and you will need to aim yourself at the switch to deflect you to the right. You will then curve, and burst through the window. When you land and wake up, continue right to see the ending. 
{{Walkthrough}}
